Kadena app for Ledger devices
Copyright 2026 Smart Pacts

This product is a Rust implementation of the Kadena Ledger application. Its
behaviour, command protocol and review screens follow the C implementation
developed by Zondax AG (https://zondax.ch), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, of which this repository is the maintained continuation.

The original Kadena Ledger application and its command protocol (the legacy
command family) were developed by Obsidian Systems LLC, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

The JSON tokenizer is a port of jsmn by Serge Zaitsev (MIT License).
